A||||10||fieroburton||34 foot 2m4 burnout !||||14||
Z||000000||fieroburton||07-20-2001||11:52 PM||||today I was moving my fiero around so I can get some room in my back yard and I haven't drove this car that much and can sometimes drive a stick but today I was trying to pull up my driveway and so I pushed down the clutch and gave it a little gas and release the clutch slowly giving it a little more gas as I started to pull forward then I heard a swooshing noise and my shift light came on but by then I had the car pulled up as far as I wonted it to be . I got out and started to walk to my side door I seen a big black streak going all the way down my drive way but it was on the right side only but had tire markings ! so I measured it out to be 34 feet! that's not so bad  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>1984 2M4 SE <BR>    <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fieroburton/1.html" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/fieroburton/1.html</A> ||||reg||14
